    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "Can you walk me through the idea behind the addition of `totalCount > 0`?\r\n\r\nFrom what I understand now, this conflicts with `(!hasNoResults || refinementIsApplied)` because if `hasNoResults` is truthy that means that there are no results (hits), which also means the count of facet values will amount to 0.",
