    "body": "Let's say the user first clicks on 4 stars and above cause they want to see good movies, they can type a query which will yield no results but still have a total facet value which is more than 0, [like in this example](https://owgvsc.csb.app/?movies%5Bquery%5D=starship%20troopers&movies%5BratingMenu%5D%5Brating%5D=4) (sorry it does not look obvious it's selected though)\r\nNow if the user types some more stuff and the total facet count is 0 we know this query won't ever yield any result, and `canRefine` will be false as opposed to the previous implem.",
